      "text": "@simonw The refusal wasn't a rule, it was a guess. Auto mode infers intent from conversation, so the request can refuse or comply depending on phrasing. That makes refusals non-reproducible — and 'I give permission' working as a prompt is a strange place for permissions to live.",
